41a\"><code data-lake-id=\"uaba7beec\" id=\"uaba7beec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0211b25f\" id=\"u0211b25f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">1, 5, 11, 19, 29, 41,... An;</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u83b9d6bf\" id=\"u83b9d6bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3349e2e6\" id=\"u3349e2e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">答案：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u063a4eb9\" id=\"u063a4eb9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)\">An = n^2 + n - 1;</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u21c1492f\" id=\"u21c1492f\"><br></p>",
